==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 13.33~18.67 seconds<sup>400f~560f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Tails (Enemy)|Tails]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. Rushing is also a good option, as you can easily take down the base before Tails spawns.

